    "免费在线语音会把当前要读的句子发给在线语音服务；自行配置的云端声音和笔记导出（Notion、flomo、新枝）只在你选用并填了 Key 或链接时联网，要读的句子或要发的笔记直接发给你选的服务。读过的声音存在这台设备上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free online voices send the sentence being read to the online speech service. Cloud voices you configure and note exports (Notion, flomo, Xinzhi) go online only when you enable them with your own key or webhook, sending sentences or notes directly to that service. Received audio stays on this device."
