    "只有在你主动提交反馈时才会联网，通过 ntfy.sh 中转为公开的 GitHub Issue；不收集邮箱，你选择附带的日志或私密文件会在发送前用开发者公钥在本机加密。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Goes online only when you send feedback, relayed via ntfy.sh to a public GitHub Issue. No email is collected; logs and private files you attach are sealed on your device with the developer's public key before sending."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有在你主动提交反馈时才会联网，通过 ntfy.sh 中转为公开的 GitHub Issue；不收集邮箱，非图片附件和未公开的截图会在发送前用开发者公钥在本机加密。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
