    "外文朗读与克隆" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "English & cloning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外文查词与翻译使用系统离线翻译；按需下载的对齐模型与本地语音模型在设备上离线运行，原文与录音不出本机。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dictionary lookup and translation run offline via macOS; downloaded alignment and speech models run on-device so text and audio never leave your Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外文查词与翻译使用系统离线翻译；按需从 GitHub Releases 或魔搭（ModelScope）下载的对齐模型、声音包与本地语音模型都在设备上离线运行，原文与录音不出本机。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dictionary lookups and translation use the system's offline translation. On-demand alignment models, voice packs and local voice models downloaded from GitHub Releases or ModelScope all run offline on your device; your books and recordings never leave it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外文查词与翻译使用系统离线翻译；按需从 GitHub Releases、魔搭（ModelScope）或 Hugging Face 下载的对齐模型、声音包、开源字体与本地语音模型都在设备上离线运行（字体预览样字按需从 Google Fonts 加载），原文与录音不出本机。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Foreign lookups and translations use the system offline translator. Alignment models, voice packs, open-source fonts, and local voice models downloaded on demand from GitHub Releases, ModelScope, or Hugging Face run offline on this device (font preview samples load on demand from Google Fonts); your books and recordings never leave the device."
          }
        }
      }
