    "时候既然是深冬；渐近故乡时，天气又阴晦了，冷风吹进船舱中，呜呜的响，从篷隙向外一望，苍黄的天底下，远近横着几个萧索的荒村，没有一些活气。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It was the dead of winter, and as I drew near, the weather turned bleak and overcast; a cold wind whistled through the boat's cabin. Peering out through a crack in the awning, beneath a sallow sky, I saw several desolate villages scattered near and far, without a sign of life."
          }
        }
      }
    },
