        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "语阅快照-%1$@%2$@.%3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "语阅是开源项目，截图和文字一起公开，别人也能帮忙查。发之前看一眼截图里有没有隐私。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yuyue is open source: screenshots are public along with your words, so others can help look into it. Check them for anything private before sending."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "语阅没有服务器，也不收集任何数据：没有账号、没有统计、没有广告。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yuyue has no servers and collects no data: no accounts, no analytics, no ads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "语阅没有用麦克风的权限。在系统设置的“隐私与安全性 › 麦克风”里打开。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yuyue can't use the microphone. Turn it on in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Microphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "语阅没有账号、没有广告，也不做跨应用追踪。你的书、进度、笔记、划线和搜索词都只留在本地设备。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yuyue has no accounts, no ads, and no cross-app tracking. Your books, progress, notes, highlights, and search terms stay strictly on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "语阅没有账号、没有广告，也不做跨应用追踪。默认开启匿名使用统计，仅记录功能使用形态（如导入格式、界面浏览、朗读与音频功能使用），不关联身份，绝不收集书名、笔记、搜索词、网址或邮箱，可随时在「关于」页关闭。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yuyue has no accounts, no ads, and no cross-app tracking. Anonymous usage analytics are enabled by default to record usage shapes only (such as import formats, screen visits, and speech or audio feature usage) without personal identity—never book titles, notes, search terms, URLs, or emails. You can turn this off anytime in About."
          }
        }
      }
    },
