    "这 %lld 句录音只听清一部分，墨线可能跟声音错开。可以先听着，回头再调。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Only part of this sentence was heard in the recording, so the line may drift from the voice. Listen now and adjust later."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Only part of these %lld sentences was heard in the recording, so the line may drift from the voice. Listen now and adjust later."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这 %lld 句的墨线可能和声音对不上，听一下，不准就微调。" : {
