    },
    "问题反馈与崩溃诊断" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feedback & Crash Diagnostics"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问题反馈与崩溃诊断：主动提交的反馈和截图仅发给开发者，不会公开，也不收集邮箱；应用意外闪退时会在下次启动自动上报匿名崩溃堆栈和基础设备信息，用于排查修复，不关联个人身份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feedback & Crash Diagnostics: Feedback and screenshots you submit are sent privately to the developer, never published, and no email is collected. If the app crashes unexpectedly, an anonymous crash stack trace and basic device info are automatically sent on the next launch to help diagnose and fix issues, without being linked to your identity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问题反馈：只有在你主动提交反馈时才会联网，通过 ntfy.sh 中转为公开的 GitHub Issue；不收集邮箱，你选择附带的日志或私密文件会在发送前用开发者公钥在本机加密。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feedback: goes online only when you send feedback, relayed via ntfy.sh to a public GitHub Issue. No email is collected; logs and private files you attach are sealed on your device with the developer's public key before sending."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问题反馈：只有在你主动提交反馈时才会联网，通过 ntfy.sh 中转为公开的 GitHub Issue；不收集邮箱，非图片附件和未公开的截图会在发送前用开发者公钥在本机加密。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feedback: goes online only when you submit feedback, relayed via ntfy.sh to a public GitHub Issue. No email is collected; non-image attachments and private screenshots are encrypted on device with the developer's public key before sending."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问题反馈：只有在你主动提交反馈时才会联网，通过 ntfy.sh 中转为公开的 GitHub Issue；你选择附带的邮箱、日志或私密文件会在发送前用开发者公钥在本机加密。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In-app feedback: goes online only when you choose to send feedback, relayed via ntfy.sh to a public GitHub Issue. Any email, logs or private attachments you opt in to include are encrypted on device with the developer's public key before sending."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问题反馈：只有在你主动提交反馈时才会联网，通过 ntfy.sh 中转为公开的 GitHub Issue；正文与附件均会公开展示，不收集邮箱。" : {
